Description: Handle dynamic Gemm batches and validate XNNPACK capabilities
 Backport upstream's runtime batch-size fix. Also reject transposed A and
 unsupported bias broadcasts so another provider handles them; check ranks
 before indexing dimensions and handle an absent optional bias safely.
Author: Ishaan Gupta <guptaishaan@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: Qore Technologies, s.r.o.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/commit/86c6efcc3f4853b793b22f59c2c7b407855b8bbe
Bug: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/issues/31153
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-01
Copyright: 2026 Microsoft Corporation and Qore Technologies, s.r.o.
License: MIT

